---
import RootLayout from "~/layouts/RootLayout.astro";

const metadata = {
  title: "A Spotube Alternative with Artist Payouts — DeeMusiq",
  description:
    "DeeMusiq is built on the open-source Spotube project (BSD-4-Clause) and adds a native African catalog, token wallet, fair artist payouts and offline DRM. Credit where it's due.",
  keywords:
    "Spotube alternative, Spotube rebrand, open source music app, music streaming with artist payouts, DeeMusiq vs Spotube",
};
---

<RootLayout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="p-4 md:p-16 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="h1">A Spotube Alternative with Artist Payouts</h1>
    <br />
    <p class="text-surface-500">
      DeeMusiq is built on Spotube — and proud of it. We took the fast,
      open-source, cross-platform music player and grew it into an Africa-first
      streaming platform where artists get paid fairly.
    </p>
    <br /><br />

    <h2 class="h2">Credit where it's due</h2>
    <br />
    <p>
      Spotube is the excellent open-source music client created by
      <a href="https://github.com/KRTirtho" target="_blank" class="underline">Kingkor Roy Tirtho</a>
      and its community of contributors, released under the BSD-4-Clause
      license. DeeMusiq is a rebrand and continuation of that codebase, and
      we're upfront about it: the lightweight Flutter core, the no-Electron
      philosophy, and the extensible architecture all come from upstream.
    </p>
    <br />

    <h2 class="h2">What DeeMusiq adds</h2>
    <br />
    <ul class="list-disc ps-6 flex flex-col gap-2">
      <li>
        <strong>Native African catalog</strong> — first-class discovery for
        <a href="/stream-amapiano-gqom-afrobeats" class="underline">amapiano, gqom, afrobeats</a>
        and more South African sounds.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Token wallet</strong> — fans top up artists directly in the
        app; no middlemen skimming the stream.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Fair artist payouts</strong> — artists keep ownership and
        withdraw earnings via South African payment rails. Read
        <a href="/artist-payouts" class="underline">how payouts work</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Offline DRM</strong> — protected downloads keep working
        offline while keeping artists' rights intact.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <br />

    <h2 class="h2">Same spirit, same platforms</h2>
    <br />
    <p>
      Like Spotube, DeeMusiq is a native app on Android, Windows, macOS, Linux
      and iOS — no Electron, no web wrapper, no bloat. If you loved Spotube,
      you'll feel at home; if you're new, the
      <a href="/downloads" class="underline">downloads page</a> has a build
      for your device. And because we handle accounts and payments, we publish
      a clear <a href="/privacy" class="underline">privacy and POPIA stance</a>.
    </p>
    <br /><br />

    <a href="/downloads" class="btn preset-filled-primary-300-700">
      Download DeeMusiq
    </a>
  </section>
</RootLayout>
